            "t": "text",
            "v": " by 2030. Instead, new energy cars ("
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "NEVs",
            "zh": "新能源汽车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ") will be encouraged. The island’s government made these goals clear in a plan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The plan "
