            "v": "carbon emissions",
            "ref": "v-carbon-emission"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and develop new energy across the island. It makes Hainan the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " province in China to make such an effort. The island has a rich supply of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "renewable",
            "ref": "v-renewable"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " energies. These include wind, wave and "
