            "number": 4,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "nature"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " conditions also make it a great place to use NEVs. Most of these cars on the market now run on "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "batteries",
            "ref": "v-battery"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In winter, low temperatures make the batteries last for "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "few"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " hours than normal. This, however, won’t be a big "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Hainan. It’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the island throughout the year. Besides, the island covers a relatively small area. NEV owners won’t have to worry about "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "die"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " batteries."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "All of these conditions give the island its "
