            "ref": "v-unique"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " strengths to carry out "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "it"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " plan. As climate change continues to be a threat to our world, such efforts will be needed in "
